---
---
<section class="px-4 md:px-8 pt-16 md:pt-24 pb-12 md:pb-16 max-w-[1200px] mx-auto">
  <div class="max-w-[820px]">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 mb-6 border border-ws-border rounded-full font-mono text-xs text-ws-fg-secondary">
      <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-ws-accent"></span>
      Apache 2.0 · Windows-native · Any model · No WSL2
    </div>
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-ws-fg leading-[1.1] tracking-tight mb-6">
      One control desk for every<br/>AI coding agent <span class="text-ws-accent">on Windows.</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-ws-fg-secondary leading-relaxed max-w-[680px] mb-8">
      winsmux is a Windows-native control desk for AI coding agents.
      Run <code>Claude Code</code>, <code>Codex</code>, <code>Antigravity</code>, and <code>Grok Build</code> in real terminal panes —
      or bring any model through <code>OpenRouter</code>. Every run is isolated in its own git worktree,
      and you compare results with evidence before you keep anything. No WSL2.
    </p>
    <div class="flex gap-3 flex-wrap">
      <a href="#install" class="bg-ws-accent text-ws-bg rounded px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-sm no-underline hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity">
        Install winsmux
      </a>
      <a href="https://github.com/Sora-bluesky/winsmux" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
         class="bg-transparent text-ws-fg border border-ws-border rounded px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium no-underline hover:border-ws-border-focus transition-colors">
        View on GitHub →
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="providers" class="px-4 md:px-8 pb-10 md:pb-12 max-w-[1200px] mx-auto">
  <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-2 font-mono text-xs text-ws-fg-muted">
    <span class="text-ws-fg-secondary uppercase tracking-[0.08em]">Works with</span>
    <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
    <span class="text-ws-fg">Claude Code</span>
    <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
    <span class="text-ws-fg">Codex</span>
    <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
    <span class="text-ws-fg">Antigravity</span>
    <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
    <span class="text-ws-fg">Grok Build</span>
    <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
    <span class="text-ws-fg">OpenRouter</span>
  </div>
</section>
